# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values (.env.local is gitignored).
#
# Everything here is EXPO_PUBLIC_, which means Expo inlines it into the client
# bundle at build time. Treat every value below as public: it ships inside the
# app and can be read out of a downloaded build. Only keys that are safe to
# publish belong in this file.

# From your Supabase project's Settings > API page: https://supabase.com/dashboard
# The anon key is designed to be public — it grants nothing on its own, since
# every table is gated by row-level security.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional: request access at https://edmtrain.com/page/api — until approved,
# leave blank and EDMTrain results are skipped.
#
# NOTE: this one is still client-side and therefore still exposed. It is left
# that way only because it is unset and unused; if EDMTrain access is ever
# granted, route it through an Edge Function the same way Ticketmaster is
# before shipping.
EXPO_PUBLIC_EDMTRAIN_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT here any more: the Ticketmaster key.
#
# It used to live in this file as EXPO_PUBLIC_TICKETMASTER_API_KEY, which meant
# it shipped inside every build. Concerts are now fetched through the `concerts`
# Edge Function, which holds the key server-side:
#
#   supabase secrets set TICKETMASTER_API_KEY=...
#   supabase functions deploy concerts
#
# If you still have EXPO_PUBLIC_TICKETMASTER_API_KEY in your .env.local, delete
# it. Nothing reads it, but leaving it there keeps publishing the key.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Also NOT here: the Perplexity key for the Ask Edge Function.
#
# The Ask feature routes through the Perplexity Router API. Its key is
# billable per call, so it lives server-side as a Supabase secret and never
# in this file:
#
#   supabase secrets set PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=...
#   supabase secrets set PERPLEXITY_MODEL=<slug from GET /router/v1/models>
#   supabase secrets set PERPLEXITY_INPUT_COST_PER_MTOK=...   # optional, for cost display
#   supabase secrets set PERPLEXITY_OUTPUT_COST_PER_MTOK=...  # optional
#
# The Router API requires paid credits on the Perplexity org; without them
# every call returns 403 regardless of the key being valid.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
